  </div>

  <h2>Meet the routine</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <p>This is a routine word bank, not one required lifestyle. Learn the words as chunks and choose only the ones that fit a fictional or voluntary schedule.</p>
  <div class="figure-grid">
